{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d0/kpfvs8r2x3avkylvttyusthwqbvsmz5.mp3","text":"博士，整理好的资料我放在这里了。欸，不用不用，不必谢，这些我都做惯了的，并不辛苦......那个，您口渴吗，我再给您泡点茶来吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_001.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/sbff3gihc6ybsonnp6c5g19ie4jmdhz.mp3","text":"博士，整理好的资料我放在这里了。欸，不用不用，不必谢，这些我都做惯了的，并不辛苦......那个，您口渴吗，我再给您泡点茶来吧？","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/57/6dz2289se3xiwrsbef1y85bsymjb5ri.mp3","text":"我除了炎国话，其他语言都说得很一般，其实最初有点害怕，不太敢开口。但大家都很友好，也有很多炎国的同乡在，呼......真的是松了一口气......","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/8mq8byjdz6ryqxfcmaxazbjl12yi9zh.mp3","text":"博士，打扰一下，请问您知道普罗旺斯小姐她们去哪儿了吗？老家那边寄了点特产来，这段时间受了很多照顾，我想拿去分给大家......啊，博士的份当然也有的，请尝尝吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/99/cth5t4erzqapno1x4yud3hg6dcx15i8.mp3","text":"博、博士，可以请您帮我一起找一下我的团子吗？就是那个黑白的小玩偶！明明记得是放在这里的，却怎么也找不着......呜，拜托您了，没有那个的话，晚上会睡不着......","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_004.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cc/tea5pk5tk8cqo8ksjqvidmqcep5y87f.mp3","text":"我除了炎国话，其他语言都说得很一般，其实最初有点害怕，不太敢开口。但大家都很友好，也有很多炎国的同乡在，呼......真的是松了一口气......","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/36/o2ma9rc1xulozuqarz1xt15uupcl9o4.mp3","text":"博士，打扰一下，请问您知道普罗旺斯小姐她们去哪儿了吗？老家那边寄了点特产来，这段时间受了很多照顾，我想拿去分给大家......啊，博士的份当然也有的，请尝尝吧！","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/01/jn77dnsz4b26rvjpvskwfxq6ympagda.mp3","text":"博、博士，可以请您帮我一起找一下我的团子吗？就是那个黑白的小玩偶！明明记得是放在这里的，却怎么也找不着......呜，拜托您了，没有那个的话，晚上会睡不着......","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/65/fa8sjqn7k9wcoxd9ct14pr1r6feuin1.mp3","text":"救援队总要和天灾打交道，待得久了，得病也在所难免，大家都不会因此而排斥谁。我的体表结晶位置不太起眼，按上去也不会痛......有的时候，我都要忘了还有这个长在我身上了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/01/2kaw0bq0ivludh5xl2dgayrg2ijk0dq.mp3","text":"最初到救援队时，不习惯那里的气候，也吃不惯当地的食物，晚上想家睡不着，偷偷哭过好多回。但是，就算是这样，每次看到那些被我们救助的人，我又觉得，好像还能继续努力下去......","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_006.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2d/cw8lu6vzlydi9u17q43a8vouylzq0ft.mp3","text":"救援队总要和天灾打交道，待得久了，得病也在所难免，大家都不会因此而排斥谁。我的体表结晶位置不太起眼，按上去也不会痛......有的时候，我都要忘了还有这个长在我身上了。","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/ba8a5qwfq2fq26lq8mkumt9orsrzgmc.mp3","text":"最初到救援队时，不习惯那里的气候，也吃不惯当地的食物，晚上想家睡不着，偷偷哭过好多回。但是，就算是这样，每次看到那些被我们救助的人，我又觉得，好像还能继续努力下去......","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c5/q3j99u0qbdk77j80e4hu84un2xb7qjg.mp3","text":"博士，打扰了......最近我在自学天灾救援时的矿石病感染预防，月禾小姐推荐我来找您咨询......那个......对不起，是不是太麻烦您了？","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/5xw7j7nd2iu8c22lorz2jpyec5o8pda.mp3","text":"噫，博士，您怎么站在我背后不出声啊！欸，我拿着的是？啊，这是家里寄来的信，虽然当初擅自离开家的时候，爸妈气得说要和我断绝关系，但我家乡有句老话，叫做血浓于水......","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/49/stslwdkm263hrmfaw85qjkld4qv6hlq.mp3","text":"得了矿石病，我知道就不太可能再按照爸妈的期望那样，有个安稳的生活了。不过，我并不后悔......嘿嘿，而且如果我当初没有那样选，今天也不会遇到博士，还有罗德岛的大家了呀。","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_009.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/85/ghooorrhj85agqlurfrdxuyzmy6boyc.mp3","text":"博士，打扰了......最近我在自学天灾救援时的矿石病感染预防，月禾小姐推荐我来找您咨询......那个......对不起，是不是太麻烦您了？","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/q5p8ttm67ti3dna54bz3vp2jsie4xi4.mp3","text":"噫，博士，您怎么站在我背后不出声啊！欸，我拿着的是？啊，这是家里寄来的信，虽然当初擅自离开家的时候，爸妈气得说要和我断绝关系，但我家乡有句老话，叫做血浓于水......","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/r71t29wgzrhmgbsqz4qvg27ij3qg0d5.mp3","text":"得了矿石病，我知道就不太可能再按照爸妈的期望那样，有个安稳的生活了。不过，我并不后悔......嘿嘿，而且如果我当初没有那样选，今天也不会遇到博士，还有罗德岛的大家了呀。","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:9/91/gzg3wsh20ouq03517yujkqpzn4fq4hk.mp3","text":"博士，博士？打、打扰了，稍微起来一下，垫上这个垫子再睡吧？现在这样睡下去，报告书上的字会印在脸上的......","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_010.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/13/6v9rmm07nhpczpl78hdpmzeqlyymzdg.mp3","text":"博士，博士？打、打扰了，稍微起来一下，垫上这个垫子再睡吧？现在这样睡下去，报告书上的字会印在脸上的......","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/gnwaa4zeuz7sd1505sev8s2nul72ic3.mp3","text":"您好，我是炎国灾害救援组织“春乾”派遣来学习的成员，我叫做......啊，对、对不起，这里要用代号的吧？非常抱歉，非常抱歉，请叫我桑葚就好！","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_011.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/8lyfq5239ok5rern30xoxft0pv0c9bw.mp3","text":"您好，我是炎国灾害救援组织“春乾”派遣来学习的成员，我叫做......啊，对、对不起，这里要用代号的吧？非常抱歉，非常抱歉，请叫我桑葚就好！","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/5qedr0hwws3fttak33v4tmxpt49rn75.mp3","text":"山、山崩地裂......！这真的不是新春电影的特效吗......？","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_012.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/04/bgbs7pdu2l7lrf0op65ocleqqp2fgq7.mp3","text":"山、山崩地裂......！这真的不是新春电影的特效吗......？","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:1/17/dxqga6b2vnjy0w7xuz0q78r6xwzwocu.mp3","text":"欸，升职？真的可以吗？救援队和罗德岛，我能拿两份工资？！......好、好幸福啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_013.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/62/4ybhiceniixe7mb2yufkxc1gvc1v16s.mp3","text":"欸，升职？真的可以吗？救援队和罗德岛，我能拿两份工资？！......好、好幸福啊。","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/msjyqmraf402vln3uxls1webgi8pbun.mp3","text":"这一次，不是要帮上谁的忙，而是我自己决定要这么做......博士，谢谢您一直鼓励我，现在我很确定，我所做的都是有意义的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_014.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/8won5n8ueymjoqrextc6e1h7nk2prqv.mp3","text":"这一次，不是要帮上谁的忙，而是我自己决定要这么做......博士，谢谢您一直鼓励我，现在我很确定，我所做的都是有意义的。","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/mr83fojplzvof7xhvkavljkwf2o058j.mp3","text":"我会努力协助大家的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_017.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/74/quz1be6w23gwbadege6f7nn17xm7hut.mp3","text":"我会努力协助大家的！","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/nffs5dt1c15nyfqwb6ntxp72bydy0ta.mp3","text":"欸，我当队长？我、我可以吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_018.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/dwopb22yhrejp4hu2zbe4ts0y4aq7lp.mp3","text":"欸，我当队长？我、我可以吗？","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/iklq9k2u6fksfujyftpatj77l1vb6wc.mp3","text":"好的，立刻出发。......各位，各自注意安全，结束后再见。","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_019.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fc/h7m8c6dpf5my6jbz4yfx91ulll74t05.mp3","text":"好的，立刻出发。......各位，各自注意安全，结束后再见。","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e1/jxzzl4695ihcgokegbuq9rbwtg38y2x.mp3","text":"大家小心！前面有动静！","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_020.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/j0q4ptlrm7988ouv9sye6i4ndbloghh.mp3","text":"大家小心！前面有动静！","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:9/97/6s1hijxy9jx75gfcez8jk2bh9jhc64a.mp3","text":"护目镜......好，戴好了，准备要上了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/55/an50hyb2xz7v11z4ro2gt4ycgx4b14b.mp3","text":"呼......哈！在！我、我没有紧张！","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_022.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0f/gi9i1kayre654al4y48jj70y4icpq29.mp3","text":"护目镜......好，戴好了，准备要上了！","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/ehsrvdwnpjn6cnprgbvb9pmdnv0ceqk.mp3","text":"呼......哈！在！我、我没有紧张！","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d0/fih5kh7v5sez2b6mul7zavolfkibbv5.mp3","text":"开始准备救援......！","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/67/tuklvaivgptvhghhturj7qv6443hqo6.mp3","text":"救援小队桑葚，已就位！","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_024.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/98/s4egffzs4nxdp32yz7vcg7cwqaqqzy9.mp3","text":"开始准备救援......！","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/lisa1xzq4cxvldp4grc2j524jjprf61.mp3","text":"救援小队桑葚，已就位！","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c1/rmwxjmdp76p6ek169kxyz1fydjxch2y.mp3","text":"各位请多加小心！","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/76aiwn9ui268abzfmx7to8kk13c2bdu.mp3","text":"我也......能够做到！","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/de/arqzr4whf7h9ltvr3il5i0ybfjkb7n2.mp3","text":"您在看哪里，东张西望可是很危险的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/99/i3q6yv4o68f9vewwge442ee7wqbzppu.mp3","text":"确保人员安全就是我的工作。","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_028.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/9pzbbtdble6ojwhtxy2qs5u1s0xc8fd.mp3","text":"各位请多加小心！","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/r8k9hfgbqj6c7pr2a6aqjqliq6o1y23.mp3","text":"我也......能够做到！","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/n5fg2xrre4t0128gymq552a9f7h6mr7.mp3","text":"您在看哪里，东张西望可是很危险的！","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/73/hf8qb24isq6l3fv4yg9f2qp34llmx9y.mp3","text":"确保人员安全就是我的工作。","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:6/60/tfrpom4pzf4lop01b40opfeifjwzlwv.mp3","text":"报告！区域救援行动已结束，人员疏散及保护顺利进行！太、太好了，没有人受伤......","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_029.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/81/cmn43qza92hyhunthzstkwz3czlolsq.mp3","text":"报告！区域救援行动已结束，人员疏散及保护顺利进行！太、太好了，没有人受伤......","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cd/7hy10moug7p0s6omt7ogsie5r0pq67k.mp3","text":"呼，这样就结束了。博士，我有帮上大家的忙吗......？","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_030.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5e/pbghytjem353xm158zk4dyl7t0kl19t.mp3","text":"呼，这样就结束了。博士，我有帮上大家的忙吗......？","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fc/75cdcipiyza11otiu3l27sexpd4cj6l.mp3","text":"请等一下，那些人逃走的方向并不安全......不行，我这就去把他们带回来！","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_031.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/ic4o13jgrd1omrhlbsbtz8ua5l95koj.mp3","text":"请等一下，那些人逃走的方向并不安全......不行，我这就去把他们带回来！","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/7mdhafhqzapow0jd0ol1qtbpdf7ue2z.mp3","text":"这里很危险！大家请快撤退，博士，请跟紧我！","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_032.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/02/lukmm9y0j7446znr8g0oe0nk61qgaj7.mp3","text":"这里很危险！大家请快撤退，博士，请跟紧我！","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b8/1vxzl7fnjivr11sclg3gly0w1fzevaf.mp3","text":"哇，这里就是员工宿舍......请问，需要收租金吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_033.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/14/47dfi9jzxa7stji85id5awpsu9bbd2k.mp3","text":"哇，这里就是员工宿舍......请问，需要收租金吗？","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/ovqh3ogrbrqbpzxdiap972t8eesdx7q.mp3","text":"欸，啊，对不起，对不起！","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_034.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/11/5a3j90iz4epxsl71lbyp66mgu7idn40.mp3","text":"欸，啊，对不起，对不起！","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:4/42/slbc578ewr39s33okhsc26hznx22uxc.mp3","text":"博士！虽然很感谢，但是请不要再偷偷给我挂护身符了......太多了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_036.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/gtcg4wmvxoidusfgs70p0nxuewvtoby.mp3","text":"博士！虽然很感谢，但是请不要再偷偷给我挂护身符了......太多了！","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:2/20/4loo8iaqnqj919dytqe19m6x46vge7f.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_037.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/9aqgvdyv2wqqe8n0d1z83kxbvvaifih.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:9/99/cp5f1ject11z37qnxe1387564wg7kh4.mp3","text":"新年快乐，博士。呼......没想到今年会是在罗德岛过这个节日，感觉好新奇。其实，因为工作，我已经好几年没能在这个时候回家了，真想回去看看啊，哪怕就远远地看看也好......","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_038.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/sndg5llc2a2jeertsgsdh0cw1ahwdjf.mp3","text":"新年快乐，博士。呼......没想到今年会是在罗德岛过这个节日，感觉好新奇。其实，因为工作，我已经好几年没能在这个时候回家了，真想回去看看啊，哪怕就远远地看看也好......","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/1z2vzgpnby33a2g48m7xqk78kgqipqh.mp3","text":"辛苦了，博士，今天也要工作吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_473_mberry/cn_042.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/29/k0qriilcfpy6eaix13o3e6pw8z8no98.mp3","text":"辛苦了，博士，今天也要工作吗？","alt":"voice_custom/char_473_mberry_cn_topolect/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:9/94/thfiz8qqskzkm2zc7n68r5itzyfko02.mp3","text":"博士，整理好的资料我放在这里了。欸，不用不用，不必谢，这些我都做惯了的，并不辛苦......那个，您口渴吗，我再给您泡点茶来吧？","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b3/rxjbogwqb0vzxi5d9zwp5s8oljhlpkr.mp3","text":"我除了炎国话，其他语言都说得很一般，其实最初有点害怕，不太敢开口。但大家都很友好，也有很多炎国的同乡在，呼......真的是松了一口气......","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/80/7lfnre6n7f409yn7m7ixrcr8ckjod1o.mp3","text":"博士，打扰一下，请问您知道普罗旺斯小姐她们去哪儿了吗？老家那边寄了点特产来，这段时间受了很多照顾，我想拿去分给大家......啊，博士的份当然也有的，请尝尝吧！","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/mkeydqcpzhhcbsxsgg9q67zby2jpeu9.mp3","text":"博、博士，可以请您帮我一起找一下我的团子吗？就是那个黑白的小玩偶！明明记得是放在这里的，却怎么也找不着......呜，拜托您了，没有那个的话，晚上会睡不着......","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/j978xz76y5a48hmwi14j2la1tz1av6l.mp3","text":"救援队总要和天灾打交道，待得久了，得病也在所难免，大家都不会因此而排斥谁。我的体表结晶位置不太起眼，按上去也不会痛......有的时候，我都要忘了还有这个长在我身上了。","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/opse6ipda4p5oa6ybak3wu4830f5j2c.mp3","text":"最初到救援队时，不习惯那里的气候，也吃不惯当地的食物，晚上想家睡不着，偷偷哭过好多回。但是，就算是这样，每次看到那些被我们救助的人，我又觉得，好像还能继续努力下去......","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:7/70/djpvx3hwxwi93dzz5v30zus1s1bia8s.mp3","text":"博士，打扰了......最近我在自学天灾救援时的矿石病感染预防，月禾小姐推荐我来找您咨询......那个......对不起，是不是太麻烦您了？","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/02/eda68nu7yhdc30gy382wnrb6bsikkrz.mp3","text":"噫，博士，您怎么站在我背后不出声啊！欸，我拿着的是？啊，这是家里寄来的信，虽然当初擅自离开家的时候，爸妈气得说要和我断绝关系，但我家乡有句老话，叫做血浓于水......","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/47/lxfoqnefqgs9kqtf04wqgq3vbd5kgi2.mp3","text":"得了矿石病，我知道就不太可能再按照爸妈的期望那样，有个安稳的生活了。不过，我并不后悔......嘿嘿，而且如果我当初没有那样选，今天也不会遇到博士，还有罗德岛的大家了呀。","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/pnxtmtrewvdu0kj84u5irzjqkioer9g.mp3","text":"博士，博士？打、打扰了，稍微起来一下，垫上这个垫子再睡吧？现在这样睡下去，报告书上的字会印在脸上的......","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:4/49/l7rlww3yux269p1dpgban6izixo63s1.mp3","text":"您好，我是炎国灾害救援组织“春乾”派遣来学习的成员，我叫做......啊，对、对不起，这里要用代号的吧？非常抱歉，非常抱歉，请叫我桑葚就好！","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/fgroqsz1x61cacypejsmmzqkqtm92v8.mp3","text":"山、山崩地裂......！这真的不是新春电影的特效吗......？","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:8/88/6wchmrh7731f43xrgotjdrsou7e06ty.mp3","text":"欸，升职？真的可以吗？救援队和罗德岛，我能拿两份工资？！......好、好幸福啊。","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:9/97/ad0wshvl92ey83jd4sdpalivicdj4yo.mp3","text":"这一次，不是要帮上谁的忙，而是我自己决定要这么做......博士，谢谢您一直鼓励我，现在我很确定，我所做的都是有意义的。","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/aoozcg57n7i9o7p3njze47np4umsjbu.mp3","text":"我会努力协助大家的！","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e4/kdwzkjlbwx7i0bxdme71lrixjhvzhb4.mp3","text":"欸，我当队长？我、我可以吗？","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cc/b06iuw1rujwaamjaup1zlc7d3jc0lip.mp3","text":"好的，立刻出发。......各位，各自注意安全，结束后再见。","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:9/95/31v7qep9yfsh5qnefzk4fcu6lsyhkxf.mp3","text":"大家小心！前面有动静！","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/ks9lvqzks5ywwywgdn5ht55wy39vkig.mp3","text":"护目镜......好，戴好了，准备要上了！","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/cfkjvmnk8l77nxqqe64hemfe9mz77f1.mp3","text":"呼......哈！在！我、我没有紧张！","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e2/sqmpb384bpj37m75k8pho6jvs7r41y6.mp3","text":"开始准备救援......！","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/p76j0kuk5f273mnsqj7xrlx163yqqsj.mp3","text":"救援小队桑葚，已就位！","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:1/19/cp50r1kppvgw8xgrcd52iqn93zogltd.mp3","text":"各位请多加小心！","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/de/hxng6dsgfhpikke70bh0hzp9rdcp0e7.mp3","text":"我也......能够做到！","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/41/5dm7te4vw2j91ed6vdxozb12nwwi561.mp3","text":"您在看哪里，东张西望可是很危险的！","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/q9cefit8zyvsj5ooo6t3odqzrejvt3n.mp3","text":"确保人员安全就是我的工作。","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/jb55vnsaypxqr3mc44u5mtvsglcowxc.mp3","text":"报告！区域救援行动已结束，人员疏散及保护顺利进行！太、太好了，没有人受伤......","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/op2a2ds5ijvzoqszz28lz5n5qspass0.mp3","text":"呼，这样就结束了。博士，我有帮上大家的忙吗......？","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/38/nmkwr14tlcon5kqapyuuyg0tlvb8m1e.mp3","text":"请等一下，那些人逃走的方向并不安全......不行，我这就去把他们带回来！","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c6/escaaanwqgq10z4z03gxqgm31ksrcuo.mp3","text":"这里很危险！大家请快撤退，博士，请跟紧我！","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/7url46iwba19bcb31r8cw3sldxh09eu.mp3","text":"哇，这里就是员工宿舍......请问，需要收租金吗？","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:8/86/eu22d6ifl5aki5l0xhd2xxzmjgz7b16.mp3","text":"欸，啊，对不起，对不起！","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/5ok556cyjtnx0kjrj4eps4s2gl97tk2.mp3","text":"博士！虽然很感谢，但是请不要再偷偷给我挂护身符了......太多了！","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e4/2dpcy9ovdwjbv1yyp15ln1cqdcny3lv.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:6/66/gdh63dwxosoxmz0u2b019igps3wc1ul.mp3","text":"新年快乐，博士。呼......没想到今年会是在罗德岛过这个节日，感觉好新奇。其实，因为工作，我已经好几年没能在这个时候回家了，真想回去看看啊，哪怕就远远地看看也好......","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:5/55/9omacyk72lq89myroivdfxft5jjw9vn.mp3","text":"辛苦了，博士，今天也要工作吗？","alt":"voice/char_473_mberry/cn_042.mp3"}]}}